      <title>提交到传感器数据库</title>
      <category>phyphox.org</category>
      <description>向 phyphox.org 提交您手机的传感器相关信息。

该实验将收集有关您手机及传感器的技术数据，您可以将其提交至我们的传感器数据库。经汇总后这些数据将提供给其他用户，旨在帮助我们及他人了解不同设备上传感器的可用性与性能。</description>
      <string original="Submit">提交</string>
      <string original="This experiment will collect technical data about your phone and your sensors, which you can submit to our sensor data base. The data will be aggregated and made available to other users to help us and others to learn about the availability and capability of sensors across different devices.">本实验将收集有关您的手机及传感器的技术数据，您可以将这些数据提交至我们的传感器数据库。汇总后这些数据经将提供给其他用户，旨在帮助我们及他人了解不同设备上传感器的可用性与性能。</string>
      <string original="Please place your phone on a stable surface and press start. Avoid doing this while moving (car, train, etc) or on a vibrating surface (loud music, vibrations from vehicles, etc.) as this will distort the results.">请将手机放置在平稳的表面上，然后点击“开始”。请避免在移动中（如乘坐汽车、火车等）或在有震动的环境（如大音量音乐、车辆震动等）下进行此操作，以免导致结果失真。</string>
      <string original="Phyphox will collect data for a moment and eventually tell you to submit the data.">Phyphox 会在短时间内收集数据，并最终提示您提交数据。</string>
      <string original="Step">步骤</string>
      <string original="Waiting for start">等待开始</string>
